{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_01",
      "hash": "b7a4fdbe02bb0562",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「原來如此！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_10",
      "hash": "b7a178be02b7ed8c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「我是四天王的主將！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以叫我龍之使者阿渡……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_11",
      "hash": "b7a179be02b7ef3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳應該知道，\\n龍是傳說中的神聖生物！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_12",
      "hash": "b7a17abe02b7f0f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然很難捕捉，\\n但是只要培育得當，\\r\\n實力將會天下無雙！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_13",
      "hash": "b7a17bbe02b7f2a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "牠們的身體結實得很，\\n耍小聰明的攻擊是傷不了牠們的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_14",
      "hash": "b7a174be02b7e6c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……好了！\\n差不多可以開始了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_15",
      "hash": "b7a175be02b7e873",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還是說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳打算現在\\n就夾著尾巴逃回家去呢？\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_wataru_01_p02_cave_d1404",
      "hash": "32c95de2a499f47a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_02",
      "hash": "b7a4fcbe02bb03af",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「我的龍之軍團居然會輸給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n簡直難以置信！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_26",
      "hash": "b7ac08be02c136c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\c\\n從這一刻起，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就是寶可夢聯盟的冠軍了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_16",
      "hash": "b7a176be02b7ea26",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_17",
      "hash": "b7a177be02b7ebd9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然我很想這麼說……\\c\\n但其實[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳必須\\n再與一個人對決！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_18",
      "hash": "b7a180be02b7fb24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個訓練家就是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_01",
      "hash": "b1afdeff0e8893b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哎呀哎呀！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\r\\n恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳戰勝了阿渡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_02",
      "hash": "b1afddff0e889203",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "怎麼了？\\n竟然驚訝成那樣……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_03",
      "hash": "b7a4fbbe02bb01fc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「哈哈……不是的。\\n是您來的時機太巧了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_04",
      "hash": "b7a4fabe02bb0049",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳接下來\\n的對戰對手就是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_19",
      "hash": "b7a181be02b7fcd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_20",
      "hash": "b7ac0abe02c13a27",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "才怪……"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_05",
      "hash": "b7a4f9be02bafe96",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\n其實他……比[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳更早一步\\r\\n戰勝了我們四天王！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_21",
      "hash": "b7ac09be02c13874",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "現在他才是寶可夢聯盟\\n真正的冠軍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_03",
      "hash": "b1afdcff0e889050",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_05",
      "hash": "b1afe2ff0e889a82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "至今我們都只是把\\n將四天王全部打敗的人\\c\\n作為[VAR COLOR(0006)]冠軍[VAR COLOR(0000)]記錄下來罷了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_06",
      "hash": "b1afe1ff0e8898cf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "而從這次開始，\\n寶可夢聯盟將會\\r\\n正式設立冠軍的頭銜！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_06",
      "hash": "b7a4f8be02bafce3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「博士也正是為了\\n親眼見證新冠軍的誕生，\\r\\n才專程來到這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_22",
      "hash": "b7ac0cbe02c13d8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對於解決了火箭隊事件的\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]和[VAR TRNAME(0001)]來說，\\c\\n這個頭銜確實再適合不過了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_07",
      "hash": "b7a4f7be02bafb30",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「好了，去吧！\\n登上決戰的舞台吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_main8130_doctor_04",
      "hash": "b1afe3ff0e889c35",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「我很期待能親眼見證\\n你們兩個的實力\\r\\n究竟成長到什麼境界了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_08",
      "hash": "b7a506be02bb14ad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「我很高興[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能來。\\c\\n多虧了[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n全新寶可夢聯盟的口碑越來越好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_23",
      "hash": "b7ac0bbe02c13bda",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "身為四天王的一員，\\n在對戰中我也絕對不會讓\\r\\n「龍之使者阿渡」的稱號蒙羞的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_09",
      "hash": "b7a505be02bb12fa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿渡「我的龍之軍團，\\n實力絕對是天下無雙。\\c\\n……然而[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的實力\\n卻凌駕在我之上！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_24",
      "hash": "b7ac06be02c1335b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳應該很清楚吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main8130_dragon_25",
      "hash": "b7ac05be02c131a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要向[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這個冠軍挑戰的人……\\c\\n正在決戰的舞台上等著[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main8130_kairyu_01",
      "hash": "69e15e0a46c97cc4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "快龍「蠻哆～！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8130_max",
      "hash": "5d3c1f816b09a27b"
    }
  ]
}
